# Upcoming follows show-completed: gc hides done entries and entries inside done projects, and gc again shows them.
file <<END
Old: @done({today})
	- Inside @due({today+2})
- Done task @due({today+1}) @done({today})
- Open task @due({today+1})
END
keys gU
see - Inside  Old
see ✔ Done task
keys gc
hide Inside
hide Done task
see ▌ - Open task
keys gc
see - Inside  Old
